### Policy-Bound Capital Tiers

Funding amounts and score thresholds are strictly tied to risk policy profiles:

| Policy Profile | Action Type | Required Score | Funding Amount | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `conservative` | `TREASURY_FUNDING_RELEASE` | >= 65 | **0.20 USDC** | Conservative treasury capital release to verified counterparty |
| `balanced` | `CREDIT_LINE_DRAW` | >= 65 | **0.50 USDC** | Credit line draw authorized under balanced risk policy |
| `aggressive` | `CONDITIONAL_SETTLEMENT_RELEASE` | >= 80 | **1.00 USDC** | High-conviction conditional settlement release |

